    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All is about humans forming a wall, and breaking it! Command your people and breach walls, form up to defeat the rushing enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/58e6f78336834c3ead59acf37319611c.poster.avif?t=1727605591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/58e6f78336834c3ead59acf37319611c.webm?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/58e6f78336834c3ead59acf37319611c.mp4?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Arm your fighters and send them out to wall-breaching battles in streets, squares, and ancient lands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag a line and generate a wall of units connected by physics simulation. Design formations to hold your position, occupy the area, protect your hero, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/d363027e0e271f6f0bf02fb8115aeeef.poster.avif?t=1727605591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/d363027e0e271f6f0bf02fb8115aeeef.webm?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/d363027e0e271f6f0bf02fb8115aeeef.mp4?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All is about humans forming a wall, and breaking it! Command your people and breach walls, form up to defeat the rushing enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/58e6f78336834c3ead59acf37319611c.poster.avif?t=1727605591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/58e6f78336834c3ead59acf37319611c.webm?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/58e6f78336834c3ead59acf37319611c.mp4?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Arm your fighters and send them out to wall-breaching battles in streets, squares, and ancient lands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag a line and generate a wall of units connected by physics simulation. Design formations to hold your position, occupy the area, protect your hero, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/d363027e0e271f6f0bf02fb8115aeeef.poster.avif?t=1727605591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/d363027e0e271f6f0bf02fb8115aeeef.webm?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462080/extras/d363027e0e271f6f0bf02fb8115aeeef.mp4?t=1727605591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
